<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.10.10">
<l>māyava ṉaimatu cūta ṉaṉai</l>
<l rend="indent">mātava ṉaimaṟai yōrka ḷēttum</l>
<l>āyarka ḷēṟṟiṉai yaccu taṉai</l>
<l rend="indent">araṅkat taravaṇaip paḷḷi yāṉai</l>
<l>vēyar pukaḻvil liput tūrmaṉ</l>
<l rend="indent">viṭṭucit taṉcoṉṉa mālai pattum</l>
<l>tūya maṉattaṉa rāki vallār</l>
<l rend="indent">tūmaṇi vaṇṇaṉuk kāḷar tāmē</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>Those who, being of pure heart,</l>
<l rend="indent">master [this] garland of ten</l>
<l>composed by Viṭṭucittaṉ, king of Villiputtūr,</l>
<l rend="indent">praised by the Vēyar,</l>
<l>about Māyavaṉ, Madhusūdana, Mādava,</l>
<l rend="indent">bull of the herder [clan] praised by Vedics,</l>
<l>Acyuta, Sleeper on the serpent bed in Araṅkam,</l>
<l rend="indent">they are servants to the pure, jewel-hued One.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
